### List seasons (defaults: newest first, offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons
Accept: application/json

### Page through the list
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?offset=0&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Second page (follow links.next from the previous response)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?offset=2&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Oldest first
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?sort=startYear
Accept: application/json

### Seasons of one league (take the id from GET /leagues)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?leagueId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Seasons that started in a given year (one per league)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?startYear=2024
Accept: application/json

### Only the latest season of each league
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?current=true
Accept: application/json

### Filters, sort and paging together
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?startYear=2024&sort=-startYear&offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Offset beyond the end: 200 with empty items, not an error
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?offset=1000
Accept: application/json

### Unknown league: 200 with empty items (only the nested alias returns 404)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?leagueId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?sort=name
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit out of range (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?limit=0
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?limit=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: negative offset (400, errors.offset)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons?offset=-1
Accept: application/json
